ictable from the independent variables. A higher R² value indicates a better fit of the model.\n\n### Applications\n\nTSS, along with its components ESS and RSS, is widely used in various econometric analyses, including linear regression, ANOVA, and model diagnostics. Understanding TSS is essential for researchers and practitioners to evaluate model performance, compare different models, and make informed decisions based on the results of their analyses.\n\n### Conclusion\n\nIn summary, the Total Sum of Squares (TSS) is a critical measure in econometrics that encapsulates the total variance in a dependent variable. By breaking down TSS into Explained Sum of Squares (ESS) and Residual Sum of Squares (RSS), researchers can gain valuable insights into the effectiveness of their regression models. This decomposition not only aids in assessing model fit but also enhances the understanding of the relationship between independent and dependent variables.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": [], "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "protected_material_code": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "protected_material_text": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}], "created": 1771166153, "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_f97eff32c5", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 554, "prompt_tokens": 293, "total_tokens": 847, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}, "prompt_filter_results": [{"prompt_index": 0, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "sa